Package: mosslanding
Version: 1.0.0
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-pip, python3-venv, python3-pyqt6, qt6-qpa-plugins, desktop-file-utils, nvidia-utils | amd64-microcode
Recommends: ffmpeg, pipewire-pulse | pulseaudio, libgl1
Maintainer: xirtus <xirtus@github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/xirtus/MOSSlanding
Description: AI-powered offline text-to-speech with voice cloning
 MOSSlanding is a native desktop application for the MOSS-TTS family
 of models.  It runs entirely on your hardware — zero cloud, zero
 subscription, zero limits.
 .
 Features:
  - Zero-shot voice cloning from 5-second samples
  - 31 languages with automatic detection
  - Voice design from natural language descriptions
  - NVIDIA GPU acceleration (RTX 2070+ recommended)
  - Native Linux desktop integration (KDE/GNOME/Qt)
  - All data stays on your machine
